{"question": "One bucket of gravel has a mass of 7.05 kg. What is the mass of 20 buckets of gravel in kilograms?", "student_before": "Based on the information given, each bucket weighs 7.05 kg. To find the total weight of 20 buckets, we simply multiply the weight of one bucket by 20:

Total weight = 7.05 kg/bucket × 20 buckets

